<title>USA: CBOT soybean deliveries - Feb 28.</title>
<headline>CBOT soybean deliveries - Feb 28.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>CBOT notices for delivery against the CBOT March soybean contract for March 3 (In 000 bushels)</p>
<p>Soybeans - 1,340. Oldest long - November 12, 1996.</p>
<p>Putout - CIS/h 540, FCC/h 25, ABN AMRO/c 725, ADM/h 50.</p>
<p>Stopped - Prudential/c 30, LFG/c 15, CIS 10, 1st Option/c 15, AGE/c 20, Goldenberg/c 10, EDF and Man/c 10, Smith Barn/c 805, FCC/c 25, Iowa Grain/c 20, 1st Option/c 205, Lind-Wald/c 10, Merrill/c 10, O'Brien/c 10, ADM/c 140, Witter/c 5.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
